msgid "Found a <strong>bug</strong> in Weblate?"
msgstr "Ste našli <strong>hrošča</strong> v Weblate?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"In case it is sensitive or a <strong>security issue</strong>, please report "
"it to %(report)s. Other ways of reporting security issue can be found in the "
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"Če v kodi odkrijete <strong>varnostno težavo</strong>, pošljite poročilo na "
"%(report)s. Druge možnosti sporočanja varnostnih težav so zabeležene v <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">dokumentaciji</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Ensure the bug is not already reported</strong>, by searching "
"through the <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Prepričajte se, da napaka še ni prijavljena</strong>, tako da "
"poiščete <a href=\"%(url)s\">težave GitHub</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you're unable to find an open issue addressing the problem, <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">open a new one</a>."
msgstr ""
"Če ne najdete odprte težave, ki obravnava težavo, <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">odprite novo</a>."

msgid ""
"<strong>Follow instructions in the issue template</strong>, and provide as "
"much relevant info as possible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sledite navodilom v predlogi težave</strong> in navedite čim več "
"ustreznih informacij."

