"href=\"%(url)s\">dokumentaciji</a>."

msgid ""
"Once you have a patch ready, please follow <a href=\"#patch\">patch "
"submission</a> instructions."
msgstr ""
"Ko imate popravek pripravljen, sledite navodilom za <a "
"href=\"#patch\">oddajo popravka</a>."

